  "description": "Sherry FitzGerald Lettings are delighted to bring to market this gorgeous two bedroom ground floor apartment in the prestigious Marina Village, right in the heart of Malahide. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises: entrance porch, spacious open plan living / dining / kitchen area, hallway with additional built in storage, luxurious modern bathroom with shower, wc & whb, large double bedroom to rear and second single bedroom with patio door to rear. \n\nA wonderful feature of this property is the beautifully kept garden to the front, complete with patio furniture ideal for outdoor entertaining. Waste management is included in rent and 2 parking permits will be supplied to residents. Gas fired radiator central heating throughout. \n\nThe surrounding area is a highly sought after and centrally located area of Malahide village with the picturesque marina right on your doorstep. Malahide village centre and DART station are less than 3 minutes leisurely stroll from your front door. Malahide is a pretty seaside village with renowned and award-winning restaurants, bars, boutiques, schools, historic Malahide Castle & breath-taking coastal walks. On the leisure front, there are popular sailing, golf, cricket, rugby and tennis clubs all located nearby. The Arena Health & Fitness Club at the Grand Hotel is a short stroll from the property with full gym facilities including swimming pool. An excellent road network offers easy access to the M1/M50 motorways, Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport.",
